WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.798 --> 01:30.718
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.637 --> 01:33.972
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.848 --> 01:35.891
Black Jack.

01:47.345 --> 01:51.839
Grand Opening

01:47.507 --> 01:51.839
The World of the 22nd Century

02:12.114 --> 02:13.447
I'll be back in ten minutes.

02:13.448 --> 02:15.157
Just wait for me here.

02:15.158 --> 02:16.242
OK.

02:16.243 --> 02:20.075
But you have to come back quickly.

02:20.075 --> 02:21.163
That's right.

02:21.164 --> 02:23.124
We have to get in before three o'clock.

02:23.125 --> 02:28.629
If we get in before three, we can ride the Screamer
Machine for free, all thanks to Largo.

02:28.630 --> 02:30.673
Yay!

02:32.467 --> 02:34.160
Love Your Pet Day...

02:34.344 --> 02:36.692
Rides are free if you bring your pet.

02:36.847 --> 02:40.725
Will she act like a pet though?

02:41.310 --> 02:44.353
We'll go have fun after my work's done.

02:44.354 --> 02:45.229
OK!

02:46.565 --> 02:47.699
I'll be right back.

03:05.065 --> 03:08.265
Originally by Tezuka Osamu "In the Basement"

03:05.065 --> 03:08.265
The Tragedy in the Room

03:08.660 --> 03:12.905
Welcome, everyone.

03:14.172 --> 03:16.839
We're proud to present to you this building, built
and equipped with only the latest technology.

03:17.085 --> 03:19.128
I hope you'll enjoy seeing all of it.

03:20.922 --> 03:23.346
I'll take the penthouse.

03:23.633 --> 03:26.385
I must have it if I'm to move in.

03:26.386 --> 03:31.634
But the top floor is the penthouse restaurant, so...

03:31.975 --> 03:35.227
Then get rid of the restaurant.

03:35.228 --> 03:38.105
I won't move in if there's no restaurant.

03:38.106 --> 03:41.075
And I have a dinner party I must attend
right after this meeting too.

03:41.250 --> 03:43.502
I don't have a lot of time either.

03:43.503 --> 03:45.796
I have a meeting in Kyoto this afternoon.

03:45.797 --> 03:48.215
I don't want to miss my train.

03:48.216 --> 03:50.342
Now, now, everyone.

03:50.343 --> 03:55.555
Every floor has its own unique features,
so let's go see those first.

03:55.687 --> 03:58.767
Either way, I'll take the top floor.

03:58.768 --> 04:02.550
We'll discuss that later.

04:06.275 --> 04:07.692
Mr. President!

04:09.070 --> 04:10.284
Oh, welcome.

04:10.780 --> 04:12.697
Would you please excuse me for a minute?

04:12.698 --> 04:15.700
My executive assistant, Mr. Ham, will explain the rest.

04:24.210 --> 04:25.877
So, what do you want?

04:26.504 --> 04:32.133
You were supposed to pay the ¥50,000,000
fee for the extirpation of your brain tumor.

04:33.803 --> 04:35.679
Save me, Doctor.

04:35.680 --> 04:37.472
I'll pay you ¥50,000,000.

04:37.473 --> 04:41.151
I still have so many things I need to accomplish.

04:41.519 --> 04:45.007
I can't die yet, Doctor!

04:45.940 --> 04:48.710
Is this what you needed to accomplish?

04:48.943 --> 04:53.947
¥50,000,000 is just too outrageous.

04:53.948 --> 04:56.950
You only got rid of  a tumor the size of a pea.

04:56.951 --> 05:00.912
And that pea-sized tumor was about
to make you brain dead.

05:02.665 --> 05:06.418
But still, I won't pay that fee!

05:06.419 --> 05:09.879
I can't afford to waste money on unnecessary
things-not even a penny!

05:09.880 --> 05:13.392
So the fee to save your life was a waste?

05:13.634 --> 05:15.885
Either way, I'm not paying you!

05:15.886 --> 05:17.721
Now, go home!

05:18.764 --> 05:23.143
Hey, I'll let you have an office here.

05:23.144 --> 05:25.895
A three-year lease would come out to about ¥50,000,000.

05:26.772 --> 05:29.649
Is this building really worth that much?

05:29.650 --> 05:30.984
I'll show you around.

05:30.985 --> 05:31.726
Let's go.

05:32.862 --> 05:35.613
Doc's taking too long.

05:40.077 --> 05:42.829
I'll go get him.

05:42.830 --> 05:46.352
But he told us to wait here.

05:46.500 --> 05:49.336
Do you want the amusement park
to close before we get there?

05:49.960 --> 05:52.092
You should stay here!

05:53.758 --> 05:54.883
Doc!

06:00.306 --> 06:01.806
Where'd you come from?

06:02.266 --> 06:04.976
I came to look for Doc.

06:04.977 --> 06:08.980
He's talking with the president of this building.

06:08.981 --> 06:13.568
The president is in a meeting with
customers on the top floor...

06:13.667 --> 06:15.195
Wait up!

06:20.284 --> 06:21.576
Hey! You!

06:22.953 --> 06:24.370
Wait!

06:29.043 --> 06:32.003
A kid's going up one of the elevators!

06:32.296 --> 06:33.296
Find her!

06:34.072 --> 06:35.072
What...

06:40.721 --> 06:42.180
I found her!

06:43.015 --> 06:46.935
This is the Rainbow Floor.

06:46.936 --> 06:49.729
It's filled with negative ions.

06:51.315 --> 06:52.190
Right away.

07:07.331 --> 07:09.415
Ohmigewdness.

07:10.501 --> 07:13.197
I just saw the face of a kid!

07:13.420 --> 07:16.223
Ghosts showing up even before it opens?

07:16.423 --> 07:18.091
What a bad omen.

07:19.593 --> 07:21.636
Hey, what are you doing here, Pinoco?

07:22.054 --> 07:24.180
I told you to wait in the car.

07:24.618 --> 07:27.918
But you were taking too long.

07:28.310 --> 07:30.603
What's a kid doing here?

07:30.604 --> 07:32.605
I'm not a kid!

07:32.606 --> 07:35.066
I'm eighteen years old.

07:35.514 --> 07:39.850
Anyway, what kind of security system do you have?

07:40.281 --> 07:44.033
As one of the largest insurance companies in the country,

07:44.034 --> 07:46.786
I don't want to move in here unless you can
guarantee both fire and theft prevention.

07:46.787 --> 07:49.747
I'm glad you asked.

07:50.124 --> 07:55.628
In this day and age, you never know when
people or mother nature might attack.

07:55.629 --> 07:57.171
However,

07:57.172 --> 08:02.427
we've prepared a special facility
to protect you from such things.

08:02.646 --> 08:04.589
Where is this facility?

08:04.847 --> 08:08.850
We can take the express elevator
to the basement and go see it.

08:08.851 --> 08:09.660
Come along.

08:17.109 --> 08:23.865
Each floor has one hundred and eight cameras that
monitor the whereabouts of everyone inside.

08:24.450 --> 08:25.867
What's the matter?

08:26.702 --> 08:28.870
A kid snuck into the building and...

08:29.246 --> 08:30.788
She's right here.

08:30.789 --> 08:32.635
She's with one of the customers.

08:33.709 --> 08:35.501
Shall we go?

08:51.393 --> 08:53.978
Aren't they done yet?

08:56.315 --> 08:58.608
My ears hurt.

08:58.609 --> 08:59.776
Yawn.

08:59.777 --> 09:01.235
That'll fix it.

09:07.478 --> 09:11.245
Now, everyone, this won't take too long.

09:11.246 --> 09:12.914
Let's take a quick look.

09:18.170 --> 09:19.962
This is big.

09:21.048 --> 09:23.354
It's not just big.

09:23.634 --> 09:27.637
Ham, prepare to demonstrate the security wall.

09:28.222 --> 09:30.848
But we're not done testing it.

09:30.849 --> 09:32.600
Just do it!

09:33.644 --> 09:36.604
Let's go into this room.

09:38.357 --> 09:41.067
This is shelter number one.

09:41.068 --> 09:43.861
It was built to protect you with the latest technology.

09:45.155 --> 09:47.773
Now, Ham, show them.

09:48.075 --> 09:48.989
Yes sir.

09:49.201 --> 09:52.286
Pushing this red button lowers the firewall.

09:52.512 --> 09:53.287
Like this.

10:14.685 --> 10:16.352
What now?

10:17.813 --> 10:21.152
We're now completely isolated from the outside world.

10:21.441 --> 10:26.362
There are twenty-four layers of protection in this
wall-enough to withstand even a nuclear attack.

10:26.461 --> 10:28.240
We get it, we get it.

10:28.407 --> 10:29.515
Now, open it.

10:29.658 --> 10:31.492
I don't like being boxed in.

10:31.493 --> 10:33.537
Yes, right away.

10:34.329 --> 10:38.583
When you need to open it, just push this green button.

10:38.584 --> 10:40.751
Like this.

10:42.087 --> 10:42.837
Oh?

10:44.381 --> 10:45.006
Oh?

10:46.133 --> 10:47.466
Oh?

10:47.467 --> 10:49.218
Don't give me "oh.”

10:49.219 --> 10:50.469
Open it now!

10:51.013 --> 10:51.846
Oh?

10:52.556 --> 10:53.806
What's wrong?

10:53.807 --> 10:56.267
Well, for some reason...

10:56.268 --> 10:58.269
Uh, it's just...

11:01.648 --> 11:03.399
Doc, here.

11:07.279 --> 11:08.278
Let me see that!

11:09.031 --> 11:14.035
This room is currently undergoing maintenance.
Please do not press any buttons...

11:37.544 --> 11:40.796
Don't tell me you can't open it.

11:40.797 --> 11:43.591
Well, sir, the button is...

11:43.707 --> 11:45.051
Don't give me that crap!

11:45.052 --> 11:47.094
Open it at once!

11:49.932 --> 11:51.307
Let me see it!

11:51.308 --> 11:54.185
I don't want to be locked in here!

11:56.767 --> 11:59.357
Call someone outside and have them open it!

12:00.484 --> 12:02.818
The phone's not connected yet either.

12:03.100 --> 12:05.780
My cell phone won't connect.

12:05.781 --> 12:07.573
Mine's out of range too.

12:07.574 --> 12:10.785
We're underground and surrounded by thick walls.

12:11.119 --> 12:12.328
What about the surveillance cameras?

12:13.622 --> 12:14.580
That won't work.

12:14.581 --> 12:16.207
The power light isn't on.

12:17.626 --> 12:19.669
Can't you open it from the inside?!

12:19.670 --> 12:21.379
Do something!

12:21.380 --> 12:23.631
I'm going waste a first-class seat!

12:25.634 --> 12:29.011
Ham! This is all your fault!

12:29.012 --> 12:30.221
What are you going to do about this?!

12:30.222 --> 12:31.639
Don't just sit there!

12:32.635 --> 12:34.558
Do something!

12:37.562 --> 12:39.689
What have I done?!

12:41.525 --> 12:42.942
Stop it!

12:45.362 --> 12:46.779
Look into my eyes!

12:58.083 --> 12:59.495
What have you done?

13:00.001 --> 13:02.568
It must be a case of panic induced by claustrophobia.

13:03.004 --> 13:05.131
Let's keep him asleep for a while.

13:06.299 --> 13:08.092
I hear a noise.

13:13.849 --> 13:15.822
The air's being sucked out.

13:16.476 --> 13:20.146
Is that in case the air's polluted with impurities?

13:20.147 --> 13:22.911
Why is that the only thing working?

13:27.201 --> 13:31.950
Let me out!

13:31.950 --> 13:34.447
Open it!

13:35.162 --> 13:36.328
Hey!

13:42.461 --> 13:44.587
How do we open the door?!

13:44.588 --> 13:47.339
How do we stop the air from getting sucked out?!

13:48.341 --> 13:50.301
I don't know.

13:50.440 --> 13:51.336
Forget it.

13:51.595 --> 13:53.988
As if he'd know how.

13:54.639 --> 13:57.766
We're going to suffocate to death in here.

13:57.930 --> 14:01.228
How can you give up so easily?!

14:01.605 --> 14:03.063
Pipe down, kid!

14:03.064 --> 14:04.565
You're using up all the air!

14:04.941 --> 14:06.192
Don't shout.

14:06.193 --> 14:09.236
And your heavy breathing wastes even more air.

14:11.740 --> 14:12.531
Damn!

14:12.532 --> 14:14.700
Stop!

14:17.996 --> 14:20.372
Someone close his mouth!

14:20.916 --> 14:22.499
But he'll die!

14:22.500 --> 14:25.878
With one less man, there will
be more air for the rest of us!

14:25.879 --> 14:27.004
How cruel!

14:27.005 --> 14:29.882
I don't want to die!

14:29.883 --> 14:32.350
I want to eat something before I die.

14:34.512 --> 14:35.763
Sharaku!

14:35.764 --> 14:37.306
Largo!

14:39.351 --> 14:40.893
Largo!

14:42.336 --> 14:43.938
Wait for me, La...

14:50.320 --> 14:52.321
This should last for a little while.

14:58.495 --> 15:01.330
There's a cord running somewhere inside the walls.

15:01.331 --> 15:05.334
If we cut that cord, the door should open!

15:07.253 --> 15:08.337
That's impossible!

15:08.338 --> 15:10.983
How could you find it inside these huge walls?

15:11.341 --> 15:14.385
And even if we did find it, we don't have any tools.

15:15.595 --> 15:17.596
I found one!

15:21.017 --> 15:23.543
Can you cut into the wall with those scalpels?

15:23.812 --> 15:26.772
Those flimsy things are useless!

15:27.399 --> 15:30.978
I'm not going to give up without trying.

15:31.346 --> 15:34.239
How are you going find it?

15:44.374 --> 15:47.148
Can you locate it by using percussion?

15:47.669 --> 15:50.246
What a tedious method.

15:50.700 --> 15:52.777
A girl came through here, didn't she?

15:53.174 --> 15:54.967
There's nobody here.

15:54.968 --> 15:57.281
The president and the guests have all left.

15:58.019 --> 16:00.806
They should still be here somewhere!

16:00.892 --> 16:01.892
Wait!

16:01.959 --> 16:02.959
Again?!

16:14.612 --> 16:17.322
G-give me water!

16:17.615 --> 16:21.994
If the phone worked, I'd make the train wait for me!

16:21.995 --> 16:25.664
People will be using this building
while our bodies rot down here.

16:27.417 --> 16:29.126
Sharaku...

16:30.086 --> 16:32.286
Another kid came in!

16:35.049 --> 16:36.133
There he is!

16:47.353 --> 16:48.729
Stop it.

16:48.730 --> 16:49.688
It's useless.

16:49.689 --> 16:50.981
We're going to die here.

16:51.649 --> 16:52.816
Water...

16:52.817 --> 16:54.443
Give me water!

16:54.903 --> 16:56.445
Be quiet!

17:08.666 --> 17:10.441
Largo! This way!

17:12.128 --> 17:13.754
Wait!

17:14.714 --> 17:16.215
The kid's headed for the basement!

17:23.723 --> 17:25.599
I can't breathe.

17:39.280 --> 17:41.379
<i>If the air stays this thin,</i>

17:41.741 --> 17:44.602
<i>we'll suffer serious brain damage even
if we do make it out of here alive.</i>

17:45.119 --> 17:47.407
<i>Damn! Where is that cord?!</i>

17:54.587 --> 17:55.379
Here!

17:56.339 --> 17:58.131
Did you find it?

17:59.467 --> 18:00.979
Yes, it's here!

18:02.303 --> 18:04.892
What if you're wrong?

18:05.139 --> 18:08.767
Then this room will become our coffin.

18:12.355 --> 18:15.524
Dig faster!

18:16.526 --> 18:19.177
I'm trying not to break the blade!

18:22.615 --> 18:27.953
Doctor, if I can eat again, I'll pay you ¥10,000,000.

18:27.954 --> 18:32.207
If I make it out alive, I'll pay just as much.

18:32.208 --> 18:36.420
If I don't have to die here, I would even pay ¥100,000,000.

18:36.421 --> 18:40.382
Me too! I'll pay you the fee in full!

18:42.010 --> 18:44.052
Pinoco! Are you OK?!

18:59.318 --> 19:01.958
<i>Damn! I'm at my limit!</i>

19:08.327 --> 19:10.328
This is the last one.

19:13.082 --> 19:14.725
My fingers are numb!

19:15.793 --> 19:16.903
Dang!

19:50.912 --> 19:52.412
It opened...

19:51.405 --> 19:52.389
Air!

19:52.413 --> 19:54.289
Me first!

19:59.921 --> 20:00.837
Pinoco!

20:06.803 --> 20:08.989
Miss, come on!

20:09.555 --> 20:11.503
You're our saving angel!

20:11.766 --> 20:16.019
If you go get us help, I'll feed you anything you want.

20:16.020 --> 20:18.522
Then I want three Pinoco Specials.

20:42.213 --> 20:43.588
Largo!

20:45.049 --> 20:47.030
Largo!

20:47.103 --> 20:49.261
Help us!

20:49.440 --> 20:50.136
Huh?!

20:50.137 --> 20:51.179
Pinoco-chan!

20:51.180 --> 20:53.098
Sharaku!

20:53.099 --> 20:54.432
It's coming from below!

20:54.433 --> 20:55.517
Hurry!

21:02.774 --> 21:05.151
Yeah!

21:10.440 --> 21:13.817
You said you'd pay ¥100,000,000 if you were saved.

21:14.527 --> 21:16.048
¥50,000,000 from you.

21:16.320 --> 21:18.941
And ¥10,000,000 each from you two.

21:19.198 --> 21:22.200
I was delirious due to the lack of oxygen.

21:22.577 --> 21:24.536
It's like sleep talking.

21:24.537 --> 21:25.996
It was only a verbal promise.

21:25.997 --> 21:27.914
I don't need to keep it

21:28.249 --> 21:30.876
Besides, we didn't sign anything.

21:31.120 --> 21:34.838
A videotape should work just as well as a signed document.

21:34.839 --> 21:35.630
Right?

21:35.631 --> 21:36.590
Sir.

21:37.913 --> 21:39.885
I would even pay ¥100,000,000.

21:39.886 --> 21:43.073
Me too! I'll pay you the fee in full!

21:46.017 --> 21:48.518
Take it, thief!

21:53.602 --> 21:55.914
It's past three o'clock already.

21:56.360 --> 22:00.030
But you were just in the Screamer Machine.

22:00.031 --> 22:03.095
Only the grown ups were screaming.

22:03.326 --> 22:04.416
That's so true.

22:07.079 --> 22:19.034
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.079 --> 22:19.034
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.152 --> 22:24.151
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.152 --> 22:24.151
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.720 --> 22:31.189
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.720 --> 22:31.189
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.733 --> 22:37.191
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.733 --> 22:37.191
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.795 --> 22:40.280
being heated up by you,

22:37.795 --> 22:40.280
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.489 --> 22:48.266
so much that I change color

22:40.489 --> 22:48.266
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.351 --> 23:00.120
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.351 --> 23:00.120
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.328 --> 23:12.059
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.328 --> 23:12.059
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.299 --> 23:23.650
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.299 --> 23:23.650
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.836 --> 23:28.757
I couldn't be happier

23:23.836 --> 23:28.757
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.985 --> 23:33.919
How does it taste?

23:28.985 --> 23:33.918
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.067 --> 24:15.043
A Contagious Disease in the Wild.

23:45.067 --> 23:47.094
Your operation failed!

23:47.307 --> 23:49.267
Impossible. The operation went perfectly!

23:49.427 --> 23:50.275
This...

23:50.527 --> 23:51.167
Wait!

23:52.367 --> 23:53.269
You too?

23:53.627 --> 23:54.754
Doc!

23:55.547 --> 23:57.117
In my lower left abdomen...

23:57.567 --> 23:59.947
Are dingos that bad of an animal?

24:00.013 --> 24:02.309
For those of us who own ranches...

24:02.563 --> 24:04.416
What's happening inside of me?

24:04.596 --> 24:05.323
Think!

24:05.863 --> 24:06.863
These are...

24:08.043 --> 24:10.723
I never dreamed of operating
on myself in a place like this.

24:11.374 --> 24:14.098
Next Karte - A Contagious Disease in the Wild.

24:15.932 --> 24:17.663
Karte NG...

24:19.128 --> 24:20.192
Ouch!

24:20.192 --> 24:21.379
Dang it!

24:21.380 --> 24:23.440
Pinoco's head's too big!
